  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "德才兼备的连线  (Turning the Radio Interview Around)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Called live onto an online radio programme about virtue and talent so the host can dredge up gossip against Chun Yuqiao, entertainment reporter Bianbian flips the script on air. Listen to Bianbian in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "在在在，您说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我忘了啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这八卦新闻每天这么多，我哪记得清啊，是不是？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这话题不是德才兼备吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "要不我说说您吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您这才不才的我不敢说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "但您这德吧，真不好说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说你作为一个文化人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "整天对人家八卦隐私那么感兴趣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说你现在这么不红，你觉得你自己算成功吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "喂？喂？信号不好断了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "在在在，您说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am here, right on the line—go ahead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我忘了啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I forgot all about it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这八卦新闻每天这么多，我哪记得清啊，是不是？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is so much tabloid gossip every day—how could I remember it clearly, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "这话题不是德才兼备吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is today's topic not having both virtue and talent?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "要不我说说您吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why do I not talk about you instead?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您这才不才的我不敢说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whether you have talent or not, I would not dare say.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "但您这德吧，真不好说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for your virtue, though, that is hard to praise.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说你作为一个文化人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at you, calling yourself a man of culture.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "整天对人家八卦隐私那么感兴趣。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All day long you take such keen interest in other people's gossip and private lives.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你说你现在这么不红，你觉得你自己算成功吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Given how unpopular you are right now, do you consider yourself a success?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "喂？喂？信号不好断了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello? Hello? Did the bad signal cut us off?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "在在在，您说。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我忘了啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
